    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Lip lesion unchanged; biopsy site healed; no mouth pain or trouble swallowing</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Positive</td><td>One episode of exertional chest tightness relieved by rest; no rest pain, fainting, or leg swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild leg tiredness on starting metoprolol, easing; no muscle pain</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No numbness of the lip or chin</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

